From 54b8d7734d5fc632af7038b6ddffdd2dc26d21b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BerryBrowser <berrybrowser@bb10.dev>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 14:26:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] QNX/BB10: Multi-process GPU bring-up and NavigationClient
 commit path.

Add experimental MP mode behind berry-mp.enable with posix_spawn child launch,
NavigationClient bind sequencing, idle-wakeup mitigations on QNX message pumps,
EGL/qnx_screen GL integration, and MP test/deploy helpers while keeping
single-process as the default stable path.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
